    "show_share": true,
    "description": "World tuberculosis Day is being observed this year with the knowledge that every third person in the world is infected with TB. This year, the Day will focus on the efforts of frontline TB care providers and their crucial role in stopping TB. The section of Pulmonary and Critical Care Medicine, Department of Medicine, Aga Khan University held a seminar on Tuesday which covered different aspects of the fight against TB especially in the context that 33 % of TB cases in the world occur in the South-East Asia Region.",
